Over the 24 sites whose own blob really is ~17K: 87K buys a MEDIAN 89% of the own->330K span (range 78-95%).
The knee is near 90K. Above it the arms are nearly indistinguishable on this metric.

The six sites whose own blob is ALREADY 42K-164K still lose to the 86,580 blob (e.g. L3.idx.wq_b 1.594e-2
vs 1.087e-2 at less than half the tokens). Thickness cannot explain that -- it is the distribution the blob
was summed under, the same provenance effect measured in st_pack_levers_20260916.
